      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Wikipedia"
      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Dell_City%2C_Texas"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "Dell City developed into a farming community, with settlers arriving from Texas and New Mexico in the mid‑20th century.",
